			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize Cocoon build artifacts and Wind service catalogs\n\nUpdate the Element submodule to align build artifacts with the recent PascalCase refactoring in the Cocoon extension host. The `Target/` directory is regenerated to reflect the decomposition of `Window/Namespace` into dedicated factory modules (OutputChannel, StatusBar, Terminal, Webview), ensuring import paths match the strict directory hierarchy.\n\nConcurrently, bump the `CommandCatalogVersion` and `ServiceCatalogVersion` constants in the Wind UI service submodule. This maintains consistency between the runtime service registry and the latest upstream state, covering 544 commands and 483 services without altering the API surface.\n\nThese changes guarantee build stability across the extension host and UI layers, preventing runtime discrepancies between source and bundled artifacts.",
			"SHA": "629967d2db90eedcea217021770e86f59d843a10"
		}
